<p>List updated throughout the filing period, which ends on August 25, 2026 at 5 p.m.</p><p><strong>Last updated: 10/28/2026</strong></p><hr><h2 id="section-1">Multnomah County</h2><ul><li>Candidate filing window: June 3 - Aug. 25, 2026 at 5 p.m.&nbsp;<ul><li>Candidate filing deadline for <strong>elected incumbent</strong> candidates is Aug. 18, 2026 at 5 p.m.</li></ul></li><li><a href="/info/voters-pamphlet-filings" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="9c745c47-7b91-4072-85ad-1946054e972b" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Voters' Pamphlet Filings">County Voters' Pamphlet</a> filing deadline for County candidates is Aug. 25, 2026 at 5 p.m.</li></ul><h3>Multnomah County Chair&nbsp;</h3><div class="h-100 mb-3">
  
      
